OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fevening with outbreaks of heavy rain.
OL,7,FIt will remain cloudy overnight but
OL,8,Fthe rain will slowly ease off. Fresh
OL,9,Fto strong northerly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FA day of bright spells and
OL,12,Fscattered showers. Strong north or
OL,13,Fnorthwesterly winds will ease.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FIt will
OL,16,Fbe an unsettled period with showers or
OL,17,Flonger spells of rain. Breezy at times
OL,18,Ftoo.
